ference image, wearing sportswear.\n<Subject 3> is 花果果 (Hua Guo Guo) in <Picture 3>, preserving the exact face, hairstyle, clothing, body proportions, and overall style shown in the reference image, wearing sportswear and acting as the referee.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 15-second viral short in a hot-blooded kung-fu sports style. <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> rally a normal shuttlecock from their own halves of a badminton court with dramatic auras, slow-motion power shots, and blazing energy effects, refereed by <Subject 3>, ending on a heroic mutual acknowledgment.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 4], [Shot 5]): fully_preserved - 李永's face, hairstyle, clothing, body proportions, and style from <Picture 1> are retained in every shot; the energy effects are plot elements and do not affect character fidelity.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 3], [Shot 4], [Shot 5]): fully_preserved - 旭旭宝宝's face, hairstyle, clothing, body proportions, and style from <Picture 2> are retained in every shot; the energy effects are plot elements and do not affect character fidelity.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 4], [Shot 5]): fully_preserved - 花果果's face, hairstyle, clothing, body proportions, and style from <Picture 3> are retained in every shot.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a stylized live-action kung-fu sports style with dramatic rim lighting, glowing energy auras, slow-motion impacts, shallow depth of field, subtle film grain, and dynamic handheld camera work. The framing stays intimate throughout: medium shots, close-ups, and extreme close-ups only, with no wide shots.\n[Shot 1] A medium shot frames a badminton court with a dramatic wind sweeping dust and leaves across the floor. <Subject 1>, 李永 (Li Yong) from <Picture 1> with the exact face, hairstyle, clothing, and proportions of the reference image, stands in his own half of the court with the racket raised; <Subject 2>, 旭旭宝宝 (Xu Xu Bao Bao) from <Picture 2> with the exact appearance of the reference image, stands in the opposite half in a low, ready stance. Their gazes meet with a faint electric spark. 李永 speaks in a low, intense voice (S1): <d>[Chinese] 今天，就让我见识你的全力吧！</d> 旭旭宝宝 narrows his eyes and answers (S2): <d>[Chinese] 正合我意！</d> <Subject 3>, 花果果 (Hua Guo Guo) from <Picture 3> with the exact appearance of the reference image, stands at the net holding up the shuttlecock and announces (S3): <d>[Chinese] 比赛，开始！</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the shot cuts to a close-up of 李永's eyes as he tosses the shuttlecock and leaps into a spinning jump smash in slow motion, a glowing aura swirling around him with rising dust. The shuttlecock blazes like a comet with a golden light trail as it rockets across the net, and a ring of shockwave bursts from the impact on his racket.\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, the shot cuts to an extreme close-up of 旭旭宝宝's flashing eyes. He charges into position in his own half, swings his racket with white light trailing from the frame, and meets the shuttlecock in a slow-motion counter-smash; the collision erupts in a burst of light and wind, and the shuttlecock streaks back across the net, leaving a bright energy trail.\n[Shot 4] At 00:10.500, the shot cuts to a low-angle medium shot as 李永 leaps in his half and smashes the shuttlecock again; the shuttlecock becomes a blazing golden orb of energy hovering at the center of the net. 旭旭宝宝 leaps in his half at the same moment and strikes it; a powerful shockwave ripples outward. 花果果 raises the whistle and blows a long, sharp note, freezing both players mid-air in slow motion.\n[Shot 5] At 00:13.000, the shot cuts to a medium shot as both players land in their own halves, breathing hard with sweat on their faces, the wind still whipping around them. They raise their rackets and point at each other. 李永 says with a slight, exhausted smile (S1): <d>[Chinese] 你……很强！</d> 旭旭宝宝 answers with the same smile (S2): <d>[Chinese] 你也是！</d> The shot freezes on the heroic pose at the 15.00-second mark.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA strong wind roars across the court with leaves rustling and dust skittering. Rapid footsteps pound on both sides of the net, battle cries echo across the court, rackets cut through the air with sharp whooshes, and each impact lands with a deep boom. The referee's long whistle cuts through the chaos, followed by heavy breathing before the final freeze.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nAn epic hot-blooded orchestral score with pounding taiko drums and swelling brass builds from the opening stare-down, intensifies through the serve and counter-smash, peaks at the golden energy clash, and stops abruptly on the final heroic pose with a single deep drum hit."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1481.8245849609375, 6025.5439453125], "id": 138, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 14}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "KKvideo_latentpreviewrate": 0, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [1881.0929366787243, -5816.381767939774], "scale": 1.083470594338849}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Models", "bounding": [-1520, 4840, 700, 670]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "Sampling", "bounding": [-280, 4840, 690, 670]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Conditioning", "bounding": [-790, 4840, 480, 670]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "Decoding and create video